# Slice 2 · Complete Demo Dataset + Ask/Reply Mocks

*Fill the 12 missing demo docs · add interactive mocks for Ask My Company and Draft Reply*

---

## Why

Slice 1 ships with 4 documents. Blueprint demo dataset (project_control_pack §23.3) lists 16.
Without the full set /app/inbox feels thin and Ask My Company has nothing to query.
Still no backend — these are richer mocks built on bigger static JSON.

---

## Scope (sketch — refine when slice-1 lands)

```
content   4 more invoices · 2 more client emails · 2 supplier offers
          1 more contract · 1 HR policy · 1 internal procedure · 1 price list
          each doc:   synthetic content + expected extraction + expected summary
          source filenames already enumerated in project_control_pack §23.3

mocks     /app/ask           Ask My Company chat · answer from static JSON · no real RAG
          Draft Reply panel  inside doc detail · pre-canned drafts per client request

acceptance  16 cards in inbox
            8 questions from §23.3 "Example Ask My Company Questions" return non-empty answers
            client request docs render a Romanian Draft Reply with Approve/Edit affordances
            no broken states · still under 3-min walkthrough
```

